    "problem": "Predict reshape and transpose shapes without changing element count.",
    "code": "import numpy as np\na = np.arange(12)\nb = a.reshape(3, -1)\ncolumn = np.arange(3).reshape(-1, 1)\nprint(b.shape, b.T.shape, column.shape)\nprint(b[1].tolist())\nprint(np.shares_memory(a, b))\nprint(np.arange(3).T.shape)",
